        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=\\frac{157}{80}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{10(2x-7)}{30}-\\frac{15(5-4x)}{30}&=\\frac{12}{30}\\\\\\frac{20x-70-75+60x}{30}&=\\frac{12}{30}\\\\\\frac{80x-145}{30}&=\\frac{12}{30}\\\\80x-145&=12\\\\80x&=157\\\\x&=\\frac{157}{80}\\end{align*}$$",
